><g transform="translate(0.25 5.25)"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M2.75 1.5C2.42 1.5 2.1 1.63 1.87 1.87C1.63 2.1 1.5 2.42 1.5 2.75V10.75C1.5 11.08 1.63 11.4 1.87 11.63C2.1 11.87 2.42 12 2.75 12H4.75C5.16 12 5.5 12.34 5.5 12.75C5.5 13.16 5.16 13.5 4.75 13.5H2.75C2.02 13.5 1.32 13.21 0.81 12.69C0.29 12.18 0 11.48 0 10.75V2.75C0 2.02 0.29 1.32 0.81 0.81C1.32 0.29 2.02 7.96e-05 2.75 7.96e-05H5.94C6.35 7.96e-05 6.69 0.34 6.69 0.75C6.69 1.16 6.35 1.5 5.94 1.5H2.75ZM14 0.75C14 0.34 14.34 7.96e-05 14.75 7.96e-05H16.75C17.48 7.96e-05 18.18 0.29 18.69 0.81C19.21 1.32 19.5 2.02 19.5 2.75V10.75C19.5 11.48 19.21 12.18 18.69 12.69C18.18 13.21 17.48 13.5 16.75 13.5H13.56C13.15 13.5 12.81 13.16 12.81 12.75C12.81 12.34 13.15 12 13.56 12H16.75C17.08 12 17.4 11.87 17.63 11.63C17.87 11.4 18 11.08 18 10.75V2.75C18 2.42 17.87 2.1 17.63 1.87C17.4 1.63 17.08 1.5 16.75 1.5H14.75C14.34 1.5 14 1.16 14 0.75Z" fill="currentColor"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M22.75 5C23.16 5 23.5 5.34 23.5 5.75V7.75C23.5 8.16 23.16 8.5 22.75 8.5C22.34 8.5 22 8.16 22 7.75V5.75C22 5.34 22.34 5 22.75 5Z" fill="currentColor"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M11.17 0.13C11.51 0.36 11.6 0.82 11.37 1.17L8.15 6H12.75C13.03 6 13.28 6.15 13.41 6.4C13.54 6.64 13.53 6.94 13.37 7.17L9.37 13.17C9.14 13.51 8.68 13.6 8.33 13.37C7.99 13.14 7.9 12.68 8.13 12.33L11.35 7.5H6.75C6.47 7.5 6.22 7.35 6.09 7.1C5.96 6.86 5.97 6.56 6.13 6.33L10.13 0.33C10.36 -0.01 10.82 -0.1 11.17 0.13Z" fill="currentColor"/></g></svg> </span> <div class="bcc-bp-text"> <h3 class="bcc-bp-title">One of the largest home batteries</h3> <div class="bcc-bp-clip"> <p class="bcc-bp-body"> <strong>39.2 kWh</strong>  in every Base Core, making it one of the largest home batteries available. </p> </div> </div> </li><li class="bcc-bp-step" style="--i:1"> <span class="bcc-bp-seg" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="bcc-bp-ico" aria-hidden="true"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><g transform="translate(1.25 1.25)"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M10.75 1.5C5.64 1.5 1.5 5.64 1.5 10.75C1.5 15.86 5.64 20 10.75 20C15.86 20 20 15.86 20 10.75C20 5.64 15.86 1.5 10.75 1.5ZM0 10.75C0 4.81 4.81 0 10.75 0C16.69 0 21.5 4.81 21.5 10.75C21.5 16.69 16.69 21.5 10.75 21.5C4.81 21.5 0 16.69 0 10.75Z" fill="currentColor"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M10.75 4C11.16 4 11.5 4.34 11.5 4.75V10.29L15.09 12.08C15.46 12.26 15.61 12.71 15.42 13.09C15.24 13.46 14.79 13.61 14.41 13.42L10.41 11.42C10.16 11.29 10 11.03 10 10.75V4.75C10 4.34 10.34 4 10.75 4Z" fill="currentColor"/></g></svg> </span> <div class="bcc-bp-text"> <h3 class="bcc-bp-title">Days of backup</h3> <div class="bcc-bp-clip"> <p class="bcc-bp-body">  Approx. 36-72 hours (1-2 batteries) of backup duration. The number of batteries depends on your region and your home&#39;s energy setup. Extend duration with built-in generator recharge port or connected solar (not required). </p> </div> </div> </li><li class="bcc-bp-step" style="--i:2"> <span class="bcc-bp-seg" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="bcc-bp-ico" aria-hidden="true"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><g transform="translate(0.28 0.4)"><path d="M18.72 17.3C18.42 17.3 18.02 17.1 18.02 16.7C18.02 16.3 18.22 15.9 18.62 15.8C19.62 15.6 20.52 15 21.22 14.2C21.82 13.3 22.12 12.3 22.02 11.3C21.92 10.2 21.42 9.3 20.62 8.6C19.82 7.9 18.82 7.5 17.82 7.5H16.52C16.22 7.5 15.92 7.3 15.82 6.9C15.52 5.7 14.92 4.7 14.12 3.8C13.32 2.9 12.32 2.3 11.12 1.9C10.02 1.5 8.72 1.4 7.62 1.6C6.42 1.8 5.32 2.3 4.32 3C3.42 3.7 2.62 4.7 2.12 5.8C1.62 6.9 1.42 8.1 1.52 9.3C1.52 10.5 2.02 11.7 2.62 12.7C3.22 13.7 4.12 14.5 5.22 15.1C5.62 15.3 5.72 15.8 5.52 16.1C5.32 16.5 4.82 16.6 4.52 16.4C3.22 15.7 2.22 14.7 1.42 13.5C0.62 12.3 0.12 10.9 0.02 9.4C-0.08 8 0.12 6.5 0.72 5.2C1.32 3.9 2.22 2.7 3.32 1.8C4.42 0.9 5.82 0.3 7.22 0.1C8.62 -0.1 10.12 0 11.52 0.5C12.92 1 14.12 1.8 15.12 2.8C15.92 3.7 16.62 4.8 17.02 6H17.72C19.12 6 20.52 6.5 21.62 7.5C22.72 8.5 23.32 9.8 23.52 11.2C23.62 12.6 23.32 14 22.42 15.2C21.62 16.4 20.32 17.1 18.92 17.4C18.92 17.4 18.82 17.4 18.72 17.4V17.3Z" fill="currentColor"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M13.12 10C13.42 10.2 13.52 10.7 13.32 11L10.12 15.8H14.72C15.02 15.8 15.22 16 15.42 16.2C15.52 16.4 15.52 16.7 15.42 17L11.42 23C11.22 23.3 10.72 23.4 10.42 23.2C10.12 23 10.02 22.5 10.22 22.2L13.42 17.4H8.82C8.52 17.4 8.32 17.2 8.12 17C8.02 16.8 8.02 16.5 8.12 16.2L12.12 10.2C12.32 9.9 12.82 9.8 13.12 10Z" fill="currentColor"/></g></svg> </span> <div class="bcc-bp-text"> <h3 class="bcc-bp-title">From Texas summer to Chicago winter</h3> <div class="bcc-bp-clip"> <p class="bcc-bp-body">  Tested for -22 to 122°F, flash flooding, and submersion-rated to 3 feet. </p> </div> </div> </li><li class="bcc-bp-step" style="--i:3"> <span class="bcc-bp-seg" aria-hidden="true"></span> <span class="bcc-bp-ico" aria-hidden="true"> <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><g transform="translate(5.25 0.25)"><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M6.75 0C7.16 0 7.5 0.34 7.5 0.75V22.75C7.5 23.16 7.16 23.5 6.75 23.5C6.34 23.5 6 23.16 6 22.75V0.75C6 0.34 6.34 0 6.75 0Z" fill="currentColor"/><path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M1.24 5.24C2.04 4.45 3.12 4 4.25 4H11.75C12.16 4 12.5 4.34 12.5 4.75C12.5 5.16 12.16 5.5 11.75 5.5H4.25C3.52 5.5 2.82 5.79 2.31 6.31C1.79 6.82 1.5 7.52 1.5 8.25C1.5 8.98 1.79 9.68 2.31 10.19C2.82 10.71 3.52 11 4.25 11H9.25C10.38 11 11.46 11.45 12.26 12.24C13.05 13.04 13.5 14.12 13.5 15.25C13.5 16.38 13.05 17.46 12.26 18.26C11.46 19.05 10.38 19.5 9.25 19.5H0.75C0.34 19.5 0 19.16 0 18.75C0 18.34 0.34 18 0.75 18H9.25C9.98 18 10.68 17.71 11.19 17.19C11.71 16.68 12 15.98 12 15.25C12 14.52 11.71 13.82 11.19 13.31C10.68 12.79 9.98 12.5 9.25 12.5H4.25C3.12 12.5 2.04 12.05 1.24 11.26C0.45 10.46 0 9.38 0 8.25C0 7.12 0.45 6.04 1.24 5.24Z" fill="currentColor"/></g></svg> </span> <div class="bcc-bp-text"> <h3 class="bcc-bp-title">Affordable pricing</h3> <div class="bcc-bp-clip"> <p class="bcc-bp-body">  Automatic, whole-home backup without the five-figure cost of a generator or solar. </p> </div> </div> </li> </ol> <div class="bcc-bp-cta" data-bcc-reveal style="--rd:0.2s"> <a class="inline-flex touch-manipulation items-center justify-center gap-2 font-semibold transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-brand-primary-foreground disabled:pointer-events-none select-none whitespace-nowrap bg-brand-primary text-text-brand hover:bg-brand-primary-subtle disabled:bg-surface-subtle disabled:text-text-muted py-3 px-4 rounded text-body-lg border border-transparent bcc-bp-btn" href="/get-started" data-bcc-pricing-modal>See your pricing</a> <a class="inline-flex touch-manipulation items-center justify-center gap-2 font-semibold transition-colors duration-150 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-brand-primary-foreground disabled:pointer-events-none select-none whitespace-nowrap bg-transparent border border-brand-primary-foreground text-text-brand hover:border-brand-primary-active hover:text-brand-primary-active disabled:border-text-disabled disabled:text-text-muted py-3 px-4 rounded text-body-lg bcc-bp-btn" href="/get-started">Get started</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="bcc-witness" style="--wit-cue:0.08">  <i class="bcc-witness-stop" aria-hidden="true"></i> <div class="bcc-witness-catch" data-bcc-scrub="runway" data-bcc-flip="0.58" data-bcc-cue="0.08" data-bcc-snap-soft> <div class="bcc-witness-scene" data-bcc-screen>  <i class="bcc-witness-clear" aria-hidden="true"></i> <div class="bcc-witness-frame bcc-witness-cols"> <div class="bcc-witness-card" data-bcc-reveal> <picture class="bcc-witness-img bcc-witness-img-day"> <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="/_bpc/assets/base-core-concept/witness-day-wide-920.avif 920w, /_bpc/assets/base-core-concept/witness-day-wide-1840.avif 1840w" sizes="(min-width: 768px) min(63.7vw, 917px), calc(100vw - 56px)"> <img src="/_bpc/assets/base-core-concept/witness-day-square-674.avif" srcset="/_bpc/assets/base-core-concept/witness-day-square-674.avif 674w, /_bpc/assets/base-core-concept/witness-day-square-1348.avif 1348w" sizes="(min-width: 768px) min(63.7vw, 917px), calc(100vw - 56px)" alt="Illustration of a home with an orange roof on a sunny day, its Base battery beside the wall and a power pole carrying energy to the grid" width="1348" height="1312" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </picture> <picture class="bcc-witness-img bcc-witness-img-night"> <source media="(min-width: 768px)" srcset="/_bpc/assets/base-core-concept/witness-night-wide-920.avif 920w, /_bpc/assets/base-core-concept/witness-night-wide-1840.avif 1840w" sizes="(min-width: 768px) min(63.7vw, 917px), calc(100vw - 56px)"> <img src="/_bpc/assets/base-core-concept/witness-night-square-674.avif" srcset="/_bpc/assets/base-core-concept/witness-night-square-674.avif 674w, /_bpc/assets/base-core-concept/witness-night-square-1348.avif 1348w" sizes="(min-width: 768px) min(63.7vw, 917px), calc(100vw - 56px)" alt="Illustration of the same home at night under a stormy sky during an outage, windows glowing warm on Base battery backup" width="1348" height="1312" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </picture> <label class="bcc-witness-toggle"> <input class="bcc-witness-switch" type="checkbox" role="switch" checked aria-label="Grid power"> <span class="bcc-witness-toggle-label" aria-hidden="true">Grid</span> <span class="bcc-witness-track" aria-hidden="true"> <span class="bcc-witness-word bcc-witness-word-on">On</span> <span class="bcc-witness-word bcc-witness-word-off">Off</span> <span class="bcc-witness-knob"></span> </span> </label> </div> <div class="bcc-witness-copy">  <div class="bcc-witness-copy-day"> <h2 class="bcc-witness-head bcc-witness-head-day">When the grid is up and running:</h2> <p class="bcc-witness-body bcc-witness-body-day">
Base earns by supporting the grid, not by charging you more. During demand spikes, your Base battery helps
              balance your community’s grid: lowering prices and improving reliability.
</p> </div> <div class="bcc-witness-copy-night"> <h2 class="bcc-witness-head bcc-witness-head-night">When the grid goes down:</h2> <p class="bcc-witness-body bcc-witness-body-night">
Your Base battery automatically backs up your home when the grid goes down, delivering days of whole-home
              backup.
</p> </div> </div> </div>  <div class="bcc-witness-press"> <p class="bcc-witness-press-label text-label-sm">Featured across national news and media</p>  <div class="bcc-witness-press-window"> <div class="bcc-witness-press-track"> <ul class="bcc-witness-press-row"> <li> <img src="/_bpc/assets/wall-street-journal.225AhZyJ.avif" alt="The Wall Street Journal" style="--il:0; --ir:0" width="400" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </li><li> <img src="/_bpc/assets/new-york-times.DOTaHJhe.avif" alt="The New York Times" style="--il:0.04; --ir:0.04" width="400" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </li><li> <img src="data:image/avif;base64," alt="Bloomberg" style="--il:0.165; --ir:0.165" width="400" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </li><li> <img src="/_bpc/assets/washington-post.BhymoxuT.avif" alt="The Washington Post" style="--il:0.0225; --ir:0.025" width="400" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </li> </ul><ul class="bcc-witness-press-row bcc-witness-press-dupe" aria-hidden="true"> <li> <img src="/_bpc/assets/wall-street-journal.225AhZyJ.avif" alt="The Wall Street Journal" style="--il:0; --ir:0" width="400" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </li><li> <img src="/_bpc/assets/new-york-times.DOTaHJhe.avif" alt="The New York Times" style="--il:0.04; --ir:0.04" width="400" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </li><li> <img src="data:image/avif;base64," alt="Bloomberg" style="--il:0.165; --ir:0.165" width="400" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </li><li> <img src="/_bpc/assets/washington-post.BhymoxuT.avif" alt="The Washington Post" style="--il:0.0225; --ir:0.025" width="400" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </li> </ul><ul class="bcc-witness-press-row bcc-witness-press-dupe" aria-hidden="true"> <li> <img src="/_bpc/assets/wall-street-journal.225AhZyJ.avif" alt="The Wall Street Journal" style="--il:0; --ir:0" width="400" height="200" loading="lazy" decoding="async"> </li><li> <img src="/_bpc/a